        texto: { pt: "Corre a 40 km/h e dorme no alto das árvores. Na primavera, os machos abrem a cauda e gorgolejam a manhã inteira.", en: "Runs at 40 km/h and roosts high in trees. In spring, males fan their tails and gobble all morning." },
